                        </div>

                        <!-- Section 3: Key Script -->
                        <div class="mb-8">
                            <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-black mb-2 uppercase border-b border-gray-300">3. Critical Script</h3>
                            <div class="bg-red-50 border-l-4 border-red-600 p-4 text-gray-800 italic font-medium" id="out-script">
                            </div>
                        </div>

                        <div class="text-center mt-8 print:hidden">
                            <button onclick="window.print()" class="btn-secondary bg-black hover:bg-gray-800 text-white">🖨️ Print / Save PDF</button>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <!-- SECTION: Lead Generation -->
        <section id="leadgen-section" class="app-section hidden">
            <div class="text-center mb-10">
                <h2 class="text-4xl font-black text-white tracking-tight uppercase">Lead Generation</h2>
                <p class="mt-3 max-w-2xl mx-auto text-xl text-gray-400">
                    Using scarcity to find sellers.
                </p>
            </div>

            <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto space-y-6">
                <div class="card">
                    <div class="card-header"><h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-red-500">1. "Limited Slot" Pricing Check</h3></div>
                    <div class="card-content space-y-3 text-gray-300">
                        <p>Offer a scarce service, don't beg.</p>
                        <blockquote class="p-4 bg-neutral-900 border-l-4 border-red-600 text-gray-100 italic">
                            "I am opening 4 slots this week for a 'Market-of-the-Moment' price check. I give you the 'Sold' reality. Reply PRICE to grab a slot."
                        </blockquote>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="card">
                    <div class="card-header"><h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-red-500">2. The Buyer Match</h3></div>
                    <div class="card-content space-y-3 text-gray-300">
                        <blockquote class="p-4 bg-neutral-900 border-l-4 border-red-600 text-gray-100 italic">
                            "I am working with 3 qualified buyers looking for [Type] in [Area]. Stock is tight. If you have considered selling, I can tell you if your home is a match before we even put a board up."
                        </blockquote>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <!-- SECTION: Implementation -->
        <section id="implementation-section" class="app-section hidden">
            <div class="text-center mb-10">
                <h2 class="text-4xl font-black text-white tracking-tight uppercase">Implementation</h2>
                <p class="mt-3 max-w-2xl mx-auto text-xl text-gray-400">
                    7-Day Sprint & Review Tool.
                </p>
            </div>

            <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-10">
                <!-- 7-Day Sprint -->
                <div class="space-y-6">
                    <h3 class="text-3xl font-bold text-white">The "7-Day Fix"</h3>
                    <div class="space-y-2">
                        <div class="p-4 bg-neutral-800 rounded border-l-4 border-red-600">
                            <h4 class="font-bold text-white">DAY 1: AUDIT</h4>
                            <p class="text-sm text-gray-400">Label mandates: Hot/Balanced/Cool. Identify "Stale Fries."</p>
                        </div>
                        <div class="p-4 bg-neutral-800 rounded border-l-4 border-white">
                            <h4 class="font-bold text-white">DAY 2: REDESIGN</h4>
                            <p class="text-sm text-gray-400">Refresh photos (new Hero). Rewrite headline.</p>
                        </div>
                        <div class="p-4 bg-neutral-800 rounded border-l-4 border-red-600">
                            <h4 class="font-bold text-white">DAY 3: ALIGNMENT</h4>
                            <p class="text-sm text-gray-400">Call seller. Explain "Market of the Moment." Get adjustment.</p>
                        </div>
                        <div class="p-4 bg-neutral-800 rounded border-l-4 border-white">
                            <h4 class="font-bold text-white">DAY 4: RELAUNCH</h4>
                            <p class="text-sm text-gray-400">Update portals. Send to hot buyer list first.</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <!-- Interactive Review Sheet -->
                <div class="card border-t-8 border-t-red-600">
                    <div class="card-header">
                        <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white">Weekly Listing Review</h3>
                    </div>
                    <form id="review-form" class="card-content space-y-5">
                        <div>
                            <label class="block text-sm font-bold text-gray-400 mb-1">Property Address</label>
                            <input type="text" name="prop-address">
                        </div>
                        <div>
                            <label class="block text-sm font-bold text-gray-400 mb-1">Days on Market</label>
                            <input type="number" name="dom">
                        </div>
                        
                        <fieldset class="space-y-2">
                            <legend class="text-sm font-bold text-gray-400 mb-2">Temperature</legend>
                            <div class="flex space-x-4 text-gray-300">
                                <label class="flex items-center"><input type="radio" name="temp" class="mr-2 accent-red-600"> Hot</label>
                                <label class="flex items-center"><input type="radio" name="temp" class="mr-2 accent-red-600"> Balanced</label>
                                <label class="flex items-center"><input type="radio" name="temp" class="mr-2 accent-red-600"> Cool</label>
                            </div>
                        </fieldset>

                        <fieldset class="space-y-2">
                            <legend class="text-sm font-bold text-gray-400 mb-2">Fry Box Test</legend>
                            <div class="space-y-1 text-gray-300">
                                <label class="flex items-center"><input type="checkbox" class="mr-2 accent-red-600"> Price in "Top 3 Value"?</label>
                                <label class="flex items-center"><input type="checkbox" class="mr-2 accent-red-600"> Access controlled?</label>
                                <label class="flex items-center"><input type="checkbox" class="mr-2 accent-red-600"> Photos look scarce?</label>
                            </div>
                        </fieldset>

                        <div>
                            <label class="block text-sm font-bold text-gray-400 mb-1">Action Plan</label>
                            <textarea name="action-plan" rows="3"></textarea>
                        </div>

                        <div class="flex space-x-4">
                            <button type="button" id="reset-form-btn" class="btn-secondary">Reset</button>
                        </div>
                    </form>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

    </main>

    <footer class="mt-20 border-t border-neutral-800 bg-black">
        <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto py-8 px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 text-center">
            <p class="text-gray-500 text-sm uppercase tracking-widest">The "Empty Fry Box" Playbook | <span class="text-red-600">Confidential</span></p>
        </div>
    </footer>

    <script>
        document.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', () => {
            
            const mainNav = document.getElementById('main-nav');
            const mobileNav = document.getElementById('mobile-nav');
            const mobileMenuButton = document.getElementById('mobile-menu-button');
            const mobileMenu = document.getElementById('mobile-menu');
            const appSections = document.querySelectorAll('.app-section');

            const playbookTabs = document.getElementById('playbook-tabs');
            const playbookTabContents = document.querySelectorAll('.playbook-tab');

            const tacticFilter = document.getElementById('tactic-filter');
            const tacticPanes = document.querySelectorAll('.tactic-pane');

            const reviewForm = document.getElementById('review-form');
            const resetFormBtn = document.getElementById('reset-form-btn');

            const generateBtn = document.getElementById('generate-btn');

            function showSection(targetId) {
                appSections.forEach(section => {
                    section.classList.toggle('hidden', section.id !== targetId);
                });
                [mainNav, mobileNav].forEach(nav => {
                    nav.querySelectorAll('a').forEach(link => {
                        link.classList.toggle('active', link.dataset.target === targetId);
                    });
                });
                if (mobileMenu.classList.contains('hidden') === false) {
                    mobileMenu.classList.add('hidden');
                }
                window.scrollTo(0, 0);
            }
            
            mainNav.addEventListener('click', (e) => {
                if (e.target.matches('a[data-target]')) {
                    e.preventDefault();
                    showSection(e.target.dataset.target);
                }
            });

            mobileNav.addEventListener('click', (e) => {
                if (e.target.matches('a[data-target]')) {
                    e.preventDefault();
                    showSection(e.target.dataset.target);
                }
            });

            mobileMenuButton.addEventListener('click', () => {
                mobileMenu.classList.toggle('hidden');
            });

            if (playbookTabs) {
                playbookTabs.addEventListener('click', (e) => {
                    e.preventDefault();
                    const targetLink = e.target.closest('a[data-target]');
                    if (!targetLink) return;

                    const targetId = targetLink.dataset.target;

                    playbookTabs.querySelectorAll('a').forEach(link => {
                        link.classList.toggle('active', link.dataset.target === targetId);
                    });

                    playbookTabContents.forEach(tab => {
                        tab.classList.toggle('hidden', tab.id !== targetId);
                    });
                });
            }

            if (tacticFilter) {
                tacticFilter.addEventListener('click', (e) => {
                    e.preventDefault();
                    const targetButton = e.target.closest('button[data-target]');
                    if (!targetButton) return;

                    const targetId = targetButton.dataset.target;

                    tacticFilter.querySelectorAll('button').forEach(btn => {
                        btn.classList.toggle('active', btn.dataset.target === targetId);
                    });

                    tacticPanes.forEach(pane => {
                        pane.classList.toggle('hidden', pane.id !== targetId);
                    });
                });
            }

            if (resetFormBtn) {
                resetFormBtn.addEventListener('click', () => {
                    reviewForm.reset();
                });
            }

            if (generateBtn) {
                generateBtn.addEventListener('click', () => {
                    const area = document.getElementById('gen-area').value || 'TARGET AREA';
                    const status = document.getElementById('gen-status').value || 'No sales data provided.';
                    const p24 = document.getElementById('gen-p24').value || '#';
                    const pp = document.getElementById('gen-pp').value || '#';
                    const temp = document.getElementById('gen-temp').value;

                    if (!temp) {
                        alert("Please select a Market Temperature to generate the correct plan.");
                        return;
                    }

                    // Output Elements
                    const outArea = document.getElementById('out-area');
                    const outStatus = document.getElementById('out-status');
                    const outP24 = document.getElementById('out-p24');
                    const outPP = document.getElementById('out-pp');
                    
                    const outTempBadge = document.getElementById('out-temp-badge');
                    const outPricing = document.getElementById('out-pricing');
                    const outAccess = document.getElementById('out-access');
                    const outPhotos = document.getElementById('out-photos');
                    const outScript = document.getElementById('out-script');

                    // Set Basic Data
                    outArea.textContent = `FOR: ${area.toUpperCase()}`;
                    outStatus.textContent = status;
                    outP24.href = p24;
                    outPP.href = pp;
                    
                    // Logic for Temperature
                    let tempConfig = {};

                    if (temp === 'hot') {
                        tempConfig = {
                            badge: '🔥 HOT SELLER MARKET',
                            class: 'bg-red-100 text-red-800 border-red-300',
                            pricing: 'Push for premium. Price sharply to create a bidding war. Do not overprice, or you lose the momentum.',
                            access: 'STRICT WINDOWS. Sunday 2-4pm only. Force buyers to see each other to create social proof.',
                            photos: 'HIGH IMPACT, LOW QUANTITY. Show 5-10 photos. Make them come to the home to see the rest.',
                            script: '"This is a hot pocket. We are concentrating viewings to give everyone a fair chance. If we price sharply, your home becomes the scarce opportunity."'
                        };
                    } else if (temp === 'balanced') {
                        tempConfig = {
                            badge: '⚖️ BALANCED MARKET',
                            class: 'bg-blue-100 text-blue-800 border-blue-300',
                            pricing: 'MUST BE "TOP 3". If you are not the best value in the bracket, you will sit.',
                            access: 'CONTROLLED FLEXIBILITY. "Would you like me to hold a slot for you?" Creates personal value.',
                            photos: 'FLAWLESS PRESENTATION. Better quality than the competition is mandatory. 15-20 photos.',
                            script: '"Good homes in this area move fast. The average ones sit. Let\'s make sure you see this one early. Buyers are looking for the Top 3 value."'
                        };
                    } else { // cool
                        tempConfig = {
                            badge: '❄️ COOL BUYER MARKET',
                            class: 'bg-gray-200 text-gray-800 border-gray-400',
                            pricing: 'BRUTAL HONESTY. You must be the "bargain" or the "rare find" to get attention.',
                            access: 'APPOINTMENT ONLY. Do not sit empty show days. Book appointments to maintain dignity.',
                            photos: 'HIGHLIGHT RARITY. Focus on the ONE unique feature (e.g., ground floor, view).',
                            script: '"We planned a strong first three weeks. The market has spoken. We can either chase the market down, or adjust now to become the must-see home."'
                        };
                    }

                    // Apply Config
                    outTempBadge.textContent = tempConfig.badge;
                    outTempBadge.className = `inline-block px-3 py-1 rounded-sm text-sm font-black mb-4 uppercase tracking-wide border ${tempConfig.class}`;
                    outPricing.textContent = tempConfig.pricing;
                    outAccess.textContent = tempConfig.access;
                    outPhotos.textContent = tempConfig.photos;
                    outScript.textContent = tempConfig.script;

                    // Show Output
                    document.getElementById('generated-output').classList.remove('hidden');
                    
                    // Scroll to output
                    document.getElementById('generated-output').scrollIntoView({ behavior: 'smooth' });
                });
            }

            showSection('home-section');
        });
    </script>
</body>
</html>
